29:16.811 --> 29:20.193
[Wave]: So my name is Wave, graduate from engineering school.

29:20.193 --> 29:25.096
[Wave]: So I'm growing up in the city of Hosheng Mai, which is in the north of Thailand, where we are now.

29:27.866 --> 29:32.529
[Wave]: Last five years, I came back to Chiang Mai.

29:32.529 --> 29:35.451
[Wave]: In Thailand, you might have heard of Bangkok.

29:35.451 --> 29:37.812
[Wave]: Bangkok is the capital city and it has everything.

29:37.812 --> 29:41.154
[Wave]: It has the big city.

29:41.154 --> 29:45.576
[Wave]: I also graduated from school in Bangkok.

29:45.576 --> 29:53.081
[Wave]: But the last five years, I decided to come back to Chiang Mai and try to do something here.

29:53.843 --> 30:00.085
[Wave]: As for backup engineer, like it's nothing to do to do with art, but I like like describe like a creative thing.

30:00.085 --> 30:04.767
[Wave]: So so I try to get involved on on this community.

30:04.767 --> 30:11.310
[Wave]: And that time I think like it's starting up like kind of like interactive, interactive stuff or like technology and art stuff.

30:11.310 --> 30:16.892
[Wave]: So that's that's that's like, that's how it happened to the communities.

30:16.892 --> 30:22.734
[Wave]: And then some of my friends that I just met like during during those time we

30:24.009 --> 30:28.394
[Wave]: We tried to do the exhibition in one of the Chiang Mai Design Weeks.

30:28.394 --> 30:33.420
[Wave]: We want to be part of it, but don't know what to do.

30:33.420 --> 30:35.502
[Wave]: So I'm a little group of friends.

30:35.502 --> 30:39.006
[Wave]: I think that time it was only three Chiang Mai local artists.

30:39.006 --> 30:40.087
[Wave]: We did the exhibition

30:41.028 --> 31:03.978
[Wave]: like we use the the painting from the kids like from like the very young kids like they they do the painting for like the painting competition something like that and they're like after the competition the school like kind of like they keep it but they don't like exhibit it but they have like just throw it away you know like the school painting competition so I discovered this kind of like a

31:04.738 --> 31:08.782
[Wave]: student club and then like I try to get their painting to become alive.

31:08.782 --> 31:16.709
[Wave]: So at that time it's a lot of some exhibitions like this, like Van Gogh exhibition, Da Vinci exhibition that they use like their painting from Van Gogh.

31:17.428 --> 31:22.431
[Wave]: Da Vinci or like Monet and to create kind of like this animated stuff, right?

31:22.431 --> 31:25.733
[Wave]: It's kind of like a five years ago thing.

31:25.733 --> 31:41.241
[Wave]: I try to do the same things but with like local artists, local kids to kind of like make the point that if we can do with like the big artists who passed away like 100 years ago, we can also do with the kids, something like that.

31:41.241 --> 31:42.601
[Wave]: And that time we need a name so

31:43.883 --> 31:45.888
[Wave]: I'm not really good at the name of the group.

31:45.888 --> 31:49.336
[Wave]: So if I'm up with the name tomorrow.

31:50.372 --> 31:53.313
[Wave]: Tomorrow is Chiang Mai that time, I think.

31:53.313 --> 32:00.337
[Wave]: And then when the time passes, we get more projects and then we're turning into just Tomorrow Lab.

32:00.337 --> 32:06.360
[Wave]: So this is like our collective for Tomorrow Lab.

32:06.360 --> 32:15.064
[Wave]: Starting from technology and art and we try to explore the futures of things in the locals in this area.

32:15.064 --> 32:16.965
[Wave]: That makes me like working with the communities.

32:17.658 --> 32:24.101
[Wave]: the annual event, like the legula event to do like a media art in the temple every year on November.

32:24.101 --> 32:25.481
[Wave]: It's called Midnight Ride.

32:25.481 --> 32:40.748
[Wave]: So we build on top of the local tradition that they have the belief that at the midnight of the Lantern Festival, the community can get together and cook a festival for the young generation can be involved.

