37:35.766 --> 37:43.571
[Adam Zaretsky]: So what is the style possibility if we are engineering for something other than perfection?

37:43.571 --> 37:47.694
[Adam Zaretsky]: If we include the rest of the art world since or before

37:50.701 --> 38:14.759
[Adam Zaretsky]: realism of the Enlightenment, like a humanism of Michelangelo, and actually look backwards and forwards in time from contemporary art and from all of the human myths that are ignored in the name of the human being, the measure of all things, which is bullshit.

38:14.759 --> 38:16.881
[Adam Zaretsky]: So we try our best to make

38:19.140 --> 38:23.082
