46:15.396 --> 46:17.257
[Marc Dusseiller aka dusjagr]: It has shaped me as a human being a lot.

46:17.257 --> 46:22.098
[Marc Dusseiller aka dusjagr]: It has shaped me as someone from originally from Switzerland, how I look at the world.

46:22.098 --> 46:42.985
