[Kaspar König]: there has been some samples of newer work like gravitational waves that have been sonifying with some simple sonification methods and there is listen to colors samples that are generated by the webcam basically imagery into sound

58:32.238 --> 58:46.265
[Kaspar König]: and what I also would love to stress out is that there is a lot of beats coming in since the corona pandemic that I've suffered from just like all the others.

58:46.265 --> 58:55.990
[Kaspar König]: My little solution to keep me cheered up was actually making some beats in the morning and that's what we've been listening to in this program.

58:56.810 --> 58:57.871
